    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA truly exceptional four-bedroom detached residence presented in turnkey condition, 10 Beech View occupies a position within the highly regarded Ard Na Sidhe development, one of Clonmel's most sought-after residential areas. Finished to an excellent standard throughout and offering bright, generously proportioned accommodation, this superb family home combines contemporary comfort with practical living.\n\nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully designed. Upon entering, a welcoming entrance hallway leads to an elegant sitting room, while the heart of the home is the spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area, perfectly suited to both everyday family life and entertaining. A separate laundry room and guest W.C. provide additional convenience, while the ground floor also benefits from a generously sized bedroom complete with its own en-suite bathroom, offering excellent flexibility for guests, multi-generational living or those seeking ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the first floor comprises three well-appointed bedrooms, including an impressive principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a stylish family bathroom, all finished to a high standard and presented in immaculate condition.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys off-street parking to the front, while the beautifully maintained south-facing rear garden provides a private and sun-filled outdoor space, ideal for relaxing, dining al fresco or enjoying family time throughout the day.\n\nFurther enhancing the home's appeal are gas-fired central heating, mains service connections, quality finishes throughout, and its outstanding turnkey presentation, ensuring the next owners can move in and immediately enjoy everything this impressive property has to offer.\n\nIdeally situated within Ard Na Sidhe, the property enjoys a prime residential setting just minutes from Clonmel town centre. A wealth of amenities are all within easy reach, while the nearby N24 provides excellent connectivity to Waterford, Kilkenny and the wider region. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a superb family home in one of Clonmel's premier residential developments."
      },
